+ * deepmerge 4.3.1 semantics for plugin options: arrays are replaced, other objects except
+ * RegExp and Date are cloned and merged key by key; unsafe keys are skipped.
+ * @param {unknown} value
+ * @returns {value is Record<PropertyKey, unknown>}
